var/ — runtime data of the feed-triage service (gitignored, except this file)

Everything the service writes goes here, and nothing it writes goes anywhere else.

  state/     one JSON file per named StateHandle store (seen items, subscriptions)
  digests/   one dated digest per day: YYYY-MM-DD.md and YYYY-MM-DD.html
  runs/      one directory per driver tick: the trace, the log, the outcome
  llm/       the empty working directories model calls are run in
  serve.lock held while a driver is running; a second driver refuses to start

Deleting this directory resets the service: it will treat every feed item as new.
See docs/FEED-TRIAGE.md.
